  // ruling's enumerated list and it is disclosed rather than quietly kept: after the offer's gate
  // and its scope line were deleted, `m.unofficial` had zero readers, and the deletion discipline
  // is delete-don't-stub. `b.official` still decides which group a book sits in, so nothing else
  // moved.
